:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:14px">Heat Pumps<br/>for New Builds</h3><p style="font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);line-height:1.7">Spec it right from the start. We design and install before the GIB goes on, no disruption later.</p></div><div class="img-cell img-cell--nav" style="overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0"><img src="/constructions.webp" alt="New Build AC" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top;display:block;transition:transform 0.5s ease;aspect-ratio:4 / 3" class="nav-img"/></div><div class="nav-btn" style="background:#f0cc58;padding:18px 36px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex:0 0 auto;transition:background 0.2s"><span style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000">I Want New Build AC</span><svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></section><style>
