</style><section style="width:100%;background:var(--bg);padding:80px 0"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,4.4rem);color:#005592;text-align:center;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:72px">Auckland&#x27;s Trusted Heat<br/>Pump Specialists</h2><div class="why-grid" style="display:grid;gap:0;margin-bottom:16px"><div class="img-cell img-cell--why" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden"><img src="/custom1.webp" alt="Trident team" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover"/></div><div class="map-cta-inner" style="background:#005592;padding:64px 56px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden"><svg viewBox="0 0 346 370" style="position:absolute;right:-80px;bottom:-80px;width:580px;height:auto;pointer-events:none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g clip-path="url(#wt1)"><path d="M347.332 73.5465C308.175 189.41 278.114 275.304 34.8624 369.569L654.473 369.569C476.236 264.667 477.064 215.699 347.332 73.5465Z" fill="white" opacity="0.15"></path><path d="M348.868 129.051C296.667 242.222 274.701 295.807 16.3211 387.499L678.344 387.499C514.484 316.861 462.778 253.868 348.868 129.051Z" fill="white" opacity="0.1"></path><path d="M349.334 186.998C261.938 313.492 197.084 332.611 40.5309 386.896L669.795 386.896C483.177 306.448 479.065 329.15 349.334 186.998Z" fill="white" opacity="0.2"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="wt1"><rect width="346" height="370" fill="white" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 346 0)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg><div style="position:relative;z-index:1"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f0cc58;margin-bottom:16px">Residential, Commercial &amp; New Builds</div><h3 style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:36px;color:#fff;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:20px">Tailored Solutions.<br/>Every Time.</h3><p style="color:#fff;font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:32px">We don&#x27;t do one-size-fits-all. Whether it&#x27;s a single heat pump for your home or a full commercial HVAC system, we assess your space and recommend exactly what you need - nothing more, nothing less.</p><a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="height:58px;padding:0 32px;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2px;line-height:1;align-self:flex-start"><span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:400;opacity:0.85;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0">Book Your</span><span style="font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.02em">Free Assessment</span></a></div></div></div><div class="why-grid" style="display:grid;gap:0;margin-bottom:64px"><div style="background:#3B549E;padding:64px 56px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden"><svg viewBox="0 0 346 370" style="position:absolute;left:-80px;bottom:-80px;width:580px;height:auto;pointer-events:none;transform:scaleX(-1)" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g clip-path="url(#wt2)"><path d="M347.332 73.5465C308.175 189.41 278.114 275.304 34.8624 369.569L654.473 369.569C476.236 264.667 477.064 215.699 347.332 73.5465Z" fill="white" opacity="0.15"></path><path d="M348.868 129.051C296.667 242.222 274.701 295.807 16.3211 387.499L678.344 387.499C514.484 316.861 462.778 253.868 348.868 129.051Z" fill="white" opacity="0.1"></path><path d="M349.334 186.998C261.938 313.492 197.084 332.611 40.5309 386.896L669.795 386.896C483.177 306.448 479.065 329.15 349.334 186.998Z" fill="white" opacity="0.2"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="wt2"><rect width="346" height="370" fill="white" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 346 0)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg><div style="position:relative;z-index:1"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f0cc58;margin-bottom:16px">Our Commitment</div><h3 style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:36px;color:#fff;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:20px">We Show Up.<br/>We Get It Done.</h3><p style="color:#fff;font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:32px">No ghosting, no delays, no mess left behind. We confirm your booking, arrive on time, and leave your home or site clean and sorted. That&#x27;s the Trident standard - and it&#x27;s why Auckland keeps coming back.</p><a href="/about" class="btn btn-primary" style="height:58px;padding:0 32px;display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2px;line-height:1;align-self:flex-start"><span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:400;opacity:0.85;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0">Learn More</span><span style="font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.02em">About Us</span></a></div></div><div class="img-cell img-cell--why" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden"><img src="/commit.webp" alt="Trident installation" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover"/></div></div></div></section><section style="width:100%;background:#005592;padding:72px 0"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,4.4rem);color:#fff;text-align:center;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:72px">Simple Process.<br/>Year-Round Comfort.</h2><div class="how-it-works-grid"><div class="hiw-step"><div class="img-cell img-cell--service" style="width:100%;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:28px"><img src="/freeassesment.webp" alt="Free Assessment" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;aspect-ratio:1/1"/></div><div style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#f0cc58;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px">Step 01</div><h4 style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:36px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1">Free Assessment</h4><p style="font-size:13px;color:#fff;line-height:1.75">We visit your site and recommend the right system for your space and budget.</p></div><div class="hiw-step"><div class="img-cell img-cell--service" style="width:100%;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:28px"><img src="/supply&amp;install.webp" alt="Supply and Install" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;aspect-ratio:1/1"/></div><div style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#f0cc58;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px">Step 02</div><h4 style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:36px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1">Supply &amp; Install</h4><p style="font-size:13px;color:#fff;line-height:1.75">We handle everything - supply, installation, electrical and commissioning in one visit.</p></div><div class="hiw-step"><div class="img-cell img-cell--service" style="width:100%;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:28px"><img src="/handover.webp" alt="System Handover" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;aspect-ratio:1/1"/></div><div style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#f0cc58;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px">Step 03</div><h4 style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:36px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1">System Handover</h4><p style="font-size:13px;color:#fff;line-height:1.75">We walk you through your new system so you know exactly how to get the most from it.</p></div><div class="hiw-step"><div class="img-cell img-cell--service" style="width:100%;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:28px"><img src="/support.webp" alt="Ongoing Support" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;aspect-ratio:1/1"/></div><div style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#f0cc58;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px">Step 04</div><h4 style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:36px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1">Ongoing Support</h4><p style="font-size:13px;color:#fff;line-height:1.75">Servicing, maintenance plans and repairs - we&#x27;re here long after install day.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="audience-slider" class="audience-slider-section" style="width:100%;position:relative;overflow:hidden;height:clamp(560px, 120vw, 760px)"><div id="slider-track" style="position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;transition:transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.77,0,0.18,1);transform:translateX(-0%)"><div style="min-width:100%;height:100%;position:relative;flex-shrink:0"><img src="/home.webp" alt="Residential" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover"/><div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to right,rgba(0,40,80,0.82) 0%,rgba(0,40,80,0.45) 45%,rgba(0,40,80,0.15) 100%)"></div></div><div style="min-width:100%;height:100%;position:relative;flex-shrink:0"><img src="/office.webp" alt="Commercial" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover"/><div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to right,rgba(0,40,80,0.82) 0%,rgba(0,40,80,0.45) 45%,rgba(0,40,80,0.15) 100%)"></div></div><div style="min-width:100%;height:100%;position:relative;flex-shrink:0"><img src="/constructions.webp" alt="New Builds" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover"/><div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to right,rgba(0,40,80,0.82) 0%,rgba(0,40,80,0.45) 45%,rgba(0,40,80,0.15) 100%)"></div></div></div><div class="cutout-wrap" style="position:absolute;bottom:-5%;left:0;right:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:3;height:82%;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-end"><img src="/cutout.webp" alt="" class="