-decoration:none;transition:color 0.15s"><svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#005592" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07-1.916V6.75"></path></svg><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="b5dcdbd3daf5c1c7dcd1d0dbc19bdbcf">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></div><div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a href="/contact" style="display:flex;align-items:start;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:0 28px;height:52px;background:#f0cc58;color:#000;font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;text-decoration:none;transition:background 0.2s;white-space:nowrap;gap:5px"><span style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:400;opacity:0.6;line-height:1">Book online</span><span style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1">SCHEDULE SERVICE</span></a><a href="/contact" style="display:flex;align-items:start;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:0 28px;height:52px;background:#fff;color:#005592;font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;text-decoration:none;transition:background 0.2s;white-space:nowrap;gap:5px"><span style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:400;opacity:0.6;line-height:1">No obligation</span><span style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1">FREE QUOTE</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="about"><div class="wrap"><div class="inner"><h2>A note from our Directors</h2><blockquote>&quot;Trident was built on the belief that every home and business deserves a climate system that works - installed right, first time, and backed by a team that actually picks up the phone. That&#x27;s what we set out to build, and it&#x27;s what we&#x27;re proud to deliver every day.&quot;</blockquote><div class="about-stats hidden"><div class="about-stat"><strong>500+</strong><span>Installs per year</span></div><div class="about-stat"><strong>4.9★</strong><span>Google rating</span></div><div class="about-stat"><strong>10yr</strong><span>Serving Auckland</span></div><div class="about-stat"><strong>100%</strong><span>Licensed team</span></div></div><style>
