.faq-item.open .faq-icon svg path { stroke:#000; }
.faq-item.open .faq-q { color:#f0cc58; }
.faq-body { display:none; padding:0 48px 28px 0; font-size:16px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72); line-height:1.85; }
.faq-item.open .faq-body { display:block; }
</style><section id="faq" style="width:100%;background:#005592;padding:100px 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden"><svg viewBox="0 0 346 370" style="position:absolute;left:-80px;top:-80px;width:480px;height:auto;pointer-events:none;transform:rotate(180deg)" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g clip-path="url(#faqp2)"><path d="M347.332 73.5465C308.175 189.41 278.114 275.304 34.8624 369.569L654.473 369.569C476.236 264.667 477.064 215.699 347.332 73.5465Z" fill="white" opacity="0.15"></path><path d="M348.868 129.051C296.667 242.222 274.701 295.807 16.3211 387.499L678.344 387.499C514.484 316.861 462.778 253.868 348.868 129.051Z" fill="white" opacity="0.1"></path><path d="M349.334 186.998C261.938 313.492 197.084 332.611 40.5309 386.896L669.795 386.896C483.177 306.448 479.065 329.15 349.334 186.998Z" fill="white" opacity="0.2"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="faqp2"><rect width="346" height="370" fill="white" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 346 0)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 346 370" style="position:absolute;right:-80px;bottom:-80px;width:580px;height:auto;pointer-events:none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g clip-path="url(#faqp1)"><path d="M347.332 73.5465C308.175 189.41 278.114 275.304 34.8624 369.569L654.473 369.569C476.236 264.667 477.064 215.699 347.332 73.5465Z" fill="white" opacity="0.15"></path><path d="M348.868 129.051C296.667 242.222 274.701 295.807 16.3211 387.499L678.344 387.499C514.484 316.861 462.778 253.868 348.868 129.051Z" fill="white" opacity="0.1"></path><path d="M349.334 186.998C261.938 313.492 197.084 332.611 40.5309 386.896L669.795 386.896C483.177 306.448 479.065 329.15 349.334 186.998Z" fill="white" opacity="0.2"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="faqp1"><rect width="346" height="370" fill="white" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 346 0)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg><div class="wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1"><div class="faq-grid" style="display:grid;gap:80px;align-items:start"><div class="faq-sticky"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:20px"><span style="width:28px;height:2px;background:#f0cc58;display:block"></span><span style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f0cc58">FAQ</span></div><h2 style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,4rem);color:#fff;line-height:0.95;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin-bottom:28px">Got<br/>Questions?</h2><p style="font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:40px;max-width:28ch">Everything you need to know about our heat pump services across Auckland.</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#b7ded9d1d8f7c3c5ded3d2d9c399d9cd" class="btn btn-primary" style="height:52px;padding:0 28px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-size:14px">Ask Us Anything</a></div><div class="faq-list-container" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);width:100%"><div class="faq-item "><button class="faq-btn"><span class="faq-q">What is the best heat pump for my home?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></span></button><div class="faq-body">The best heat pump depends on the size of your room, insulation, and your specific heating and cooling needs. We offer free assessments to recommend the perfect unit for your space.</div></div><div class="faq-item "><button class="faq-btn"><span class="faq-q">Are heat pumps expensive to run?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></span></button><div class="faq-body">Heat pumps are highly energy-efficient, often producing 3-4 kW of heat for every 1 kW of electricity used. This makes them one of the most cost-effective ways to heat or cool your home.</div></div><div class="faq-item "><button class="faq-btn"><span class="faq-q">How often should I get my heat pump serviced?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></span></button><div class="faq-body">We recommend a professional service at least once a year to ensure your heat pump runs efficiently, maintains good air quality, and prevents costly breakdowns.</div></div><div class="faq-item "><button class="faq-btn"><span class="faq-q">Can a heat pump cool my home in summer?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></span></button><div class="faq-body">Yes, all our heat pumps are reverse-cycle, meaning they provide energy-efficient cooling in summer and powerful heating in winter.</div></div><div class="faq-item "><button class="faq-btn"><span class="faq-q">Do you offer warranties on your heat pumps?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></span></button><div class="faq-body">Yes, we supply and install top brands like Mitsubishi Electric, Panasonic, and Daikin, which come with comprehensive manufacturer warranties (typically up to 5 years).</div></div></div></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer><div class="wrap"><div class="footer-grid"><div class="footer-col"><img alt="Trident Electrical &amp; Air Conditioning" loading="lazy" width="180" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;height:48px;width:auto;margin-bottom:20px;display:block" src="/Trident-home-logo2.webp"/><p class