rgy-efficient cooling in summer and powerful heating in winter.\"},{\"q\":\"Do you offer warranties on your heat pumps?\",\"a\":\"Yes, we supply and install top brands like Mitsubishi Electric, Panasonic, and Daikin, which come with comprehensive manufacturer warranties (typically up to 5 years).\"}],\"description\":\"Everything you need to know about our heat pump services across Auckland.\"}]\n31:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/0h9vctsy0lvkz.js\",\"async\":true,\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\n32:[\"$\",\"$L45\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$37\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@46\"}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,":HL[\"/constructions.webp\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/commit.webp\",\"image\"]\n39:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"background\":\"#005592\",\"padding\":\"24px 28px\",\"flex\":1,\"display\":\"flex\",\"alignItems\":\"center\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\",\"gap\":16},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontFamily\":\"\\\"Satoshi\\\",sans-serif\",\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.1rem,2.5vw,1.5rem)\",\"fontWeight\":900,\"color\":\"#fff\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.15\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.02em\"},\"children\":[\"Free First\",[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],\"Annual Service\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"11px\",\"color\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.75)\",\"lineHeight\":1.5,\"marginTop\":\"10px\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#fff\"},\"children\":\"Every new heat pump install\"}],[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],\"Filter clean · coil clean · drain check · performance test\",[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],\"Valued at approx. $180\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/products\",\"className\":\"btn btn-primary\",\"style\":{\"height\":52,\"padding\":\"0 24px\",\"display\":\"inline-flex\",\"alignItems\":\"center\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":14,\"fontWeight\":800,\"flexShrink\":0,\"borderRadius\":0},\"children\":\"Claim Offer\"}]]}]